  "description": "Trekta is a personal mapping and journey-logging app. Record routes, log places of interest, save favourites, and build maps of anywhere you explore — walks, bike rides, holidays, heritage trails, and more. Your places, routes and photos stay on your phone and work without signal; map pictures need a connection the first time you view an area.",
